    "The genuine-prone worker check covers native entry, all 12 confirmation samples and two subsequent V20 steps. It does not claim a complete synthetic prone get-up, walking or physical route.",
    "The test loads the immutable core profile and directly selects the R10K hook route. Route profile and launcher validation are explicitly not exercised; the full production route is not yet registered."
